// Pull request author: DevCop95
// Change: new rule
// Title: Potential BigDiskBuster-Like Buster-File Creation in TEMP
// Sigma ID: 15755e6b-a54d-4a6e-9773-554c724f8a63
// Status: experimental | Level: medium
// Author: DevCop95
// Date: 2026-09-20 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: defense-impairment, T1685
// Description: Detects the creation of GUID-braced files in user TEMP directories. This corresponds to the
//   buster-file stage of the BigDiskBuster technique, where hidden files sized to all free disk
//   space are created to cause Windows Defender platform and signature updates to fail due to disk
//   exhaustion.
// False positives:
//   - Software installers staging temporary payloads using GUID-braced names
//   - Developer test suites creating GUID-named temporary fixtures
// References:
//   - https://github.com/DevCop95/BDB-Guardian
//   - https://github.com/MSNightmare/BigDiskBuster
//   - https://www.levelblue.com/blogs/spiderlabs-blog/filling-the-well-nightmare-eclipses-bigdiskbuster-and-the-defender-update-that-never-lands
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/045197a3c9ce6642816f7bd2416d74d994b014ec/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_bigdiskbuster_temp_file.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceFileEvents
| where FolderPath matches regex "\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\\\{[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}\\}$" and (not((InitiatingProcessFolderPath in~ ("C:\\Windows\\System32\\taskhost.exe", "C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\taskhost.exe")))) and (not(((InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\TeamViewer\\tv_x64.exe" or InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\TeamViewer\\tv_w32.exe") or (InitiatingProcessFolderPath contains "\\.vscode\\extensions\\" and InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\cpptools.exe") or (InitiatingProcessFolderPath startswith "C:\\Users\\" and InitiatingProcessFolderPath contains "\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\" and InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\target.exe"))))
